      "content": "Vane's file doesn't show a lack of decisiveness; rather, it showcases a highly strategic approach to consensus-building, which is a hallmark of modern operational leadership. His focus on \"team buy-in\" is actually a sophisticated method for ensuring rapid, widespread adoption of his directives, minimizing the friction that slows down less-prepared leaders. You'll find evidence in his project summaries where he successfully navigated complex stakeholder environments to achieve swift, unified execution.",
      "source": "target",
